 predicted classes.\n","\n","For binary classification, the four outcomes are:\n","\n","\n","*  **True Positive (TP)** : Actual Pass and Predicted Pass.\n","*  **True Negative (TN)** : Actual Fail and predicted Fail.\n","*  **False Poistive (FP)** : Actual Fail but predicted Pass.\n","*  **False Negative (FN)** : Actual Pass but predicted Fail.\n","\n","---\n","\n","\n","\n"],"metadata":{"id":"-0H6346_4XdZ"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["cm = confusion_matrix(y_test, y_pred, labels=[0, 1])\n","print(\"Confusion Matrix: \")\n","print(cm)\n","\n","#Display the matrix with row and column labels\n","cm_df= pd.DataFrame(\n","    cm,\n","    index=['Actual Fail (0)', 'Actual Pass (1)'],\n","    columns=['Predicted Fail (0)', 'Predicted Pass (1)']\n",")\n","\n","cm_df"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":164},"id":"GJ5SC85vDl1Y","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1793856048214,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":30,"user":{"displayName":"RAMYA","userId":"01350120883926889481"}},"outputId":"488ba0c9-f3f0-469e-8039-2ee616443054"},"execution_count":68,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Confusion Matrix: \n","[[2 0]\n"," [0 2]]\n"]},{"output_type":"execute_result","data":{"text/plain":["                 Predicted Fail (0)  Predicted Pass (1)\n","Actual Fail (0)                   2                   0\n","Actual Pass (1)                   0                   2"],"text/html":["\n","  <div id=\"df-0d556750-5950-44df-9201-4c744ed63509\" class=\"colab-df-container\">\n","    <div>\n","<style scoped>\n","    .dataframe tbody tr th:only-of-type {\n","        vertical-align: middle;\n","    }\n","\n","    .dataframe tbody tr th {\n","        vertical-align: top;\n","    }\n","\n","    .dataframe thead th {\n","        text-align: right;\n","    }\n","</style>\n","<table border=\"1\" class=\"dataframe\">\n","  <thead>\n","    <tr style=\"text-align: right;\">\n","      <th></th>\n","      <th>Predicted Fail (0)</th>\n","      <th>